Wand rays bounce off walls, even when they kill their target.  Wands of
death are probably not safe to play with unless you have magic
resistance, as even when firing diagonally beams sometimes take weird
bounces.  The really dangerous thing about Medusa, by the way, isn't
her combat ability but her petrification gaze, which can be turned
against her by having reflection, but so long as you're blindfolded you
can probably kill her without much trouble.

